From 982a0a9e3ac708402b3f2376e94e14979413a25c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kostersitz <mkostersitz@mac.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 19:21:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Drop OmniJaws from the product

OmniJaws depends on modules that are only in ponces' private vendor repo
(ax_compose, crdroid apps resources) and cannot be built from public
sources. ParanoidSense stays: its PixelOS fork ships the face libraries.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 config/packages.mk | 4 ----
 1 file changed, 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/config/packages.mk b/config/packages.mk
index 88154e8..d00a3ae 100644
--- a/config/packages.mk
+++ b/config/packages.mk
@@ -8,7 +8,3 @@ PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
 # SystemUI plugins
 PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
     QuickAccessWallet
-
-# Weather
-PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
-    OmniJaws
-- 
2.48.1

